# Canopy project layout

Before adding, moving, or scaffolding any file, **read** `docs/ccgs/CANOPY-PROJECT-MANIFEST.md`.

- Unity gameplay only under `grow-sim/Canopy/Assets/_Game/`. Never dump scripts, SO assets, or scenes on `Assets/` root or `_Game/` root.
- Put new scripts in the matching folder: `Scripts/Data` (SO types), `Runtime` (DTO/state), `View` (world MB), `UI`, `Events`, `Editor`, thin `Core` (save/session only).
- SO assets: `Data/{Config,Events,Items,Strains,Equipment}/`. Channels = `EC_*`. Strains = `Strain_`. Feeds = `Item_FeedN` / `P` / `K`.
- Scenes: `Farm` is the one playable Faz 1 scene; `Bootstrap` is index 0. Do not hand-edit `.unity` / `.prefab` YAML.
- CCGS `src/` is not a second engine. No Phaser, no gameplay C# there.
- New playable slice: update `production/qa/` play-cases **and** `production/learnings/` if the loop changed.
- Feature / logic-doc / asset prompts: run `scenario-engine` first (quality layer, not a `game-designer` replacement).
